OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AJump in energy bills drives UK
OL,4,Ainflation to highest rate for four
OL,5,Amonths
OL,6,
OL,7,FJuly's reading is the highest since
OL,8,FMarch but some price growth slowed.
OL,9,FFood inflation, at 1.3%, is at its
OL,10,Flowest rate for close to five years.
OL,12,FExperts said the inflation figure is
OL,13,Funlikely to influence the Bank of
OL,14,FEngland to change its key interest rate
OL,15,Fat its next meeting in September.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
